" ghpr setup  7/7 Review                                                                                                 "
"Write this config?                                     ┌ config.toml ──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"↑↓ scroll the file; Back changes an answer.            │setup_version = 1                                              │"
"                                                       │                                                               │"
"Writes ~/.config/ghpr/config.toml.                     │[profiles.work]                                                │"
"Backs up the current file first, next to it            │gh_user = "me-work"                                            │"
"(config.toml.bak-<time>).                              │default = true                                                 │"
"Moves seen/snoozed/muted state                         │team_reviews.teams = ["acme/old"]                              │"
"~/.local/state/ghpr/state.json →                       │bots = ["deploy-svc"]                                          │"
"~/.local/state/ghpr/profiles/work/state.json (it was   │                                                               │"
"collected with gh's active account, me-work).          │                                                               │"
